    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a good start. i've also heard a lot of people online saying these plans are actually just a way for the government to restrict where people can drive or even lock us into certain zones. do you think those people are just falling for conspiracy theories or is there actually a legitimate point being made there?",
