      "content": "wow, that's a pretty strong take. i wasn't expecting it to go that far. so, if these plans are basically just about political control, does that mean the whole concept is fundamentally flawed and shouldn't be implemented? or is there any way it could actually work without being a disaster for civil liberties?",
